g `product_id must be\n314:         unique` for a foreign key that cannot be. Giving step C the model it has\n315:         to agree with is the same move as every other chained step.\n316:         \"\"\"\n317:         vocab = vocabulary.Vocabulary(entities=self._entities())\n318:         block = prompts.entity_block(vocab) if vocab.entity_names else None\n319:         self._generate(\n320:             INVARIANTS,\n321:             prompts.invariants(requirements, block),\n322:             grammar_open.invariant_list(INVARIANTS),\n323:         )\n324: \n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 325]"
