            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4:2. **Expense model** — id, amount_cents (int), description, expense_date (str, ISO date), category_id (FK), payment_method (cash/card/transfer), is_recurring (bool)\n5:3. **Budget model** — id, category_id (FK), month (str like \"2024-01\"), amount_limit_cents (int), UNIQUE(category_id, month)\n6:   → DDL: use table-level `UNIQUE(category_id, month)`, not inline `month TEXT UNIQUE`\n7:4. **ExpenseRepository** — SQLite storage with CRUD + filtering by date range, category, payment_method + monthly/yearly aggregation queries\n8:5. **CategoryRepository** — SQLite storage with CRUD + find expenses for a category\n9:6. **BudgetRepository** — SQLite storage with CRUD + find budgets by month + check if a category has exceeded its budget\n11:   - list_expenses(category_id (Optional[int]), start_date (Optional[date]), end_date (Optional[date]), payment_method (Optional[str])): lists expenses filtered by optional category, date range, payment method — all params are optional, so passing no filters returns all expenses\n13:   - add_expense: validates category exists, adds expense, checks if budget exceeded after insertion\n16:   - get_monthly_report(month): returns total spent, per-category breakdown, budget status (on_track/warning/exceeded) for a given \"YYYY-MM\" month\n18:   - get_category_spending(category_id, start_date, end_date): returns aggregated spending for a category over a period\n---\n{\n \"name\": \"category\",\n \"options\": [\n  {\n   \"name\": \"--help\",\n   \"short\": \"-h\",\n   \"type\": \"bool\",\n   \"required\": false,\n   \"default\": null\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"--version\",\n   \"short\": \"-v\",\n   \"type\": \"bool\",\n   \"required\": false,\n   \"default\": null\n  }\n ],\n \"subcommands\": [\n  {\n   \"name\": \"add\",\n   \"options\": [\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-name\",\n     \"short\": \"-n\",\n     \"type\": \"str\",\n     \"required\": true,\n     \"default\": null\n    },\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-description\",\n     \"short\": \"-d\",\n     \"type\": \"str\",\n     \"required\": false,\n     \"default\": null\n    },\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-icon\",\n     \"short\": \"-i\",\n     \"type\": \"str\",\n     \"required\": false,\n     \"default\": null\n    }\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"list\",\n   \"options\": [\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-help\",\n     \"short\": \"-h\",\n     \"type\": \"bool\",\n     \"required\": false,\n     \"default\": null\n    }\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"update\",\n   \"options\": [\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-id\",\n     \"short\": \"-i\",\n     \"type\": \"int\",\n     \"required\": true,\n     \"default\": null\n    },\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-name\",\n     \"short\": \"-n\",\n     \"type\": \"str\",\n     \"required\": false,\n     \"default\": null\n    },\n    {\n     \"name\": \"-description\",\n     \"short\": \"-d\",\n     \"ty\n"
