          "type": "text",
          "text": "Confirmed: a bogus `expense → category` leaf (only `-help`) duplicates the real top-level `category` command, and the binder hung the action on it — while `--category` lives on `expense list`. The review must not pose that as a mapping question. Fixing both defects.",
