ui.py`\n- `tests/test_generator.py`\n- `tests/test_meter.py`\n- `tests/test_repairs.py`\n- `tests/test_aliases.py`\n\n## Important Context\n- Generation live tests don't yet cover the emitted `gui.py` GUI windows in headless environments; `imgui`/`glfw`/`PyOpenGL` need pip install + display.\n- GUI plan (`gui.py`) is auto-generated; toolbar/maximized states are runtime toggles, stored per-panel in `state['open']`.\n- Meter intentionally does not read/write JSON docs — pure text output, status categories as BLOCKED/DEGENERATE.\n- `--quiet` suppresses native llama.cpp logs via `suppress_stdout_stderr` and `resolve_gpu_layers` must run inside the wrapper.\n- Every code change is committed locally; `out/` generated programs are assumed regenerated in place.",
