t_parameterless_filter_names_are_stubs_not_select_alls`); live check: `find_active_members` refuses with `NotImplementedError`.\n- Test suite: 566 tests green.\n- `meter_coverage.py` scoreboard over `out/*`; generator prints `(NN% mechanical)`.\n- Surface review + alias review + expenses pipeline green end-to-end (0 blockers, generates, CLI runs, stubs honest).\n- **Slot emitters written in `generator.py`:** `SLOT_REQUIREMENTS`, `_slot_pattern`, `_complete_slots`, `_slots_usable`, `_slot_fk_param`, `_slot_date_role`, `_repo_slot_body`, `_repo_aggregate_body` (SUM/COUNT/AVG/MIN/MAX over fk + date slice), `_repo_threshold_body` (type-aware compare); `load_context` reads `method_slots.json` (`METHOD_SLOTS_NAME/KEY`) into `ctx[\"slots\"]`; `emit_repositories` now emits `import datetime`; emitter bugs fixed (hardcoded date params, stray `4646` line, removed header/docstring injection).\n- Library + expenses generation & meter after fix: library 25/34 (74%), expenses 23/36 (64%), total 48/70 (69%).\n- GUI generic pyimgui emitter (`emit_gui_pyimgui`), `gui_backend()`, `--gui-tech`; `out/gui` regenerated and verified running.\n- hello/cli_tool fallback verified.\n- Earlier bug fixes: `key_uniqueness_contradicted`, `repair_primary_key_uniqueness`, `repair_flat_command_duplicates` ordering, missing `typing` imports, `_qualify` head replacement, self-runner-up in decisions, `describe_step` gui facade display.\n\n### Active\n- **Slot review, in progress:** emitters written; still to do — wire `_repo_slot_body` into `emit_repositories`' per-method loop (currently calling `_repo_body` around generator.py:505), extend services (realized delegation only when target method body is emittable; guards excluded), create `review_slots.py` asking the finite slot questions, add tests, regenerate `out/library` + `out/expenses`, re-run meter.\n\n### Blocked\n- Guards with business logic (`BUDGET_OVERFLOW_GUARD` on `add_expense`/`check_budget_status`, `STANDARD_CRUD` oddities, custom rules like `borrow_book`) — user said discuss after slot review lands.\n- GUI \"bespoke screens\" (forms/events, cellar map, over-capacity warnings) require extraction extension — not started.\n- Probe blockers on remaining prompts (inventory stock_qty, 60 customer_id/order_id, etc.) — need human judgments / lucky reruns.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Finish the repo hook: call `_repo_slot_body(ctx, entity, model_cls, field_types, method, pattern, slots)` in `emit_repositories` when pattern is slottable and slots are usable (stub otherwise, as today).\n2. Build `review_slots.py`: walk `SLOT_REQUIREMENTS` per slottable stub method, ask finite questions (aggregate: `aggregate_func`, `target_field`, `date_field`; `fk_field` only when a matching param exists; threshold: `comparison_field`, `operator`, `threshold` = `today`/param), record `{holder, method, pattern, slots, decided_by, requirements_sha}` in `method_slots.json`.\n3. Service-level slot realization via realized delegation (skip guard patterns).\n4. Add tests for `_slots_usable`/emitters, run the 566-test suite, regenerate `out/library` + `out/expenses`, re-run `meter_coverage.py` to read the new mechanical percentages.\n5. Then discuss guards with business logic with the user.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `generator.py`: slot patterns/emitters, `load_context` slots, ctx[\"slots\"], `import datetime`, holds the wiring point in `emit_repositories`.\n- `kernel/codegen.py`: `plan_method`, `_has_params`, `MECHANICAL_PATTERNS`, `classify_crud`, `canon_tokens`, `sanitize`.\n- `meter_coverage.py`: scoreboard (methods/mechanical/stubs/cover + stub ledger by reason).\n- `kernel/repo_patterns/patterns.json`: repo pattern `required_params`/descriptions (source of slot questions).\n- `kernel/service_patterns/patterns.json`: service patterns incl. guard patterns kept out of slot scope.\n- `review_surface.py`: template for building `review_slots.py` (prompt-sha stamping, ask flow).\n- `tests/test_generator.py`: plan/slot tests live here.\n- `out/