: architecture to be faithful to and the mechanical files would be an empty\n37: shell. With `--model PATH`, the generator instead writes one\n38: `generated/app.py` from `requirements.txt` directly (LLM fallback, said aloud\n39: on stdout and in the file header); without `--model` it stops with exit 2\n40: rather than writing the empty shell silently.\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 41]"
