                "type": "text",
                "text": "Create a multi-module Python inventory management system with the following features:\n\n1. **Category model** — id, name (unique), description, reorder_threshold (optional int)\n2. **Product model** — id, sku (unique), name, category_id (FK), price_cents (int), stock_qty (int), low_active (optional bool, default False, whether the product is still sold)\n3. **CategoryRepository** — SQLite storage with CRUD + find all products belonging to a category\n4. **ProductRepository** — SQLite storage with CRUD + find products by category + find low-stock products (stock_qty below reorder_threshold) + aggregate total stock value by category\n5. **InventoryService** — business logic:\n   - add_product(sku, name, category_id, price_cents, stock_qty): validates the category exists and the sku is unique, then adds the product\n   - update_product(id, data): updates a product's fields\n   - delete_product(id): deletes a product by ID\n   - get_product_by_id(id): returns a single product by its ID\n   - list_products(category_id (Optional[int]), low_only (Optional[bool])): lists products filtered by optional category and optionally only low-stock ones; no filters returns all products\n   - restock(id, qty): increases a product's stock_qty\n   - low_stock_report(): returns products whose stock_qty is below their category's reorder_threshold\n   - stock_value_by_category(): returns the total price_cents * stock_qty per category\n6. **CLI interface using click** with nested command groups:\n   - `product add --sku --name --category --price [--stock]`\n   - `product list [--category] [--low-only]`\n   - `product update --id [--name] [--price] [---category]`\n   - `product delete --id`\n   - `product restock --id --qty`\n   - `product report low-stock`\n   - `product report value`\n   - `category add --name [--description] [--threshold]`\n   - `category list`\n   - `category update --id [--name] [--description] [--threshold]`\n   - `category delete --id`\n\nUse type hints throughout. Use SQLite with foreign keys enabled. All monetary values must be stored as integers (cents) to avoid floating-point issues. All IDs must be auto-incremented primary keys that are optional (default None) in the domain models. Implement proper error handling with custom exception classes: CategoryNotFoundError, ProductNotFoundError.\n\n===== service_contracts.json =====\n{\n  \"service_contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"service_name\": \"CategoryRepository\",\n      \"methods\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"create_category\",\n          \"description\": \"Creates a new category with the given name, description, and optional reorder_threshold.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"name\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"description\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"reorder_threshold\",\n              \"type\": \"Optional[int]\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"Category\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"MissingRequiredFieldError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"read_one_category\",\n          \"description\": \"Reads a single category by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"Optional[Category]\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"InvalidIdError\",\n            \"CategoryNotFoundError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"read_all_categories\",\n          \"description\": \"Reads all categories from the database.\",\n          \"params\": [],\n          \"return_type\": \"List[Category]\",\n          \"raises\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"update_category\",\n          \"description\": \"Updates a category's name, description, or reorder_threshold by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"name\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"description\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"reorder_threshold\",\n              \"type\": \"Optional[int]\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"Category\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"InvalidIdError\",\n            \"CategoryNotFoundError\",\n            \"MissingRequiredFieldError\",\n            \"InvalidThresholdError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"delete_category\",\n          \"description\": \"Deletes a category by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"bool\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"InvalidIdError\",\n            \"CategoryNotFoundError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"get_products_by_category\",\n          \"description\": \"Finds all products belonging to a given category by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"category_id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"List[Product]\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"InvalidIdError\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"service_name\": \"ProductRepository\",\n      \"methods\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"create_product\",\n          \"description\": \"Creates a new product with the given details.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"sku\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"name\",\n              \"type\": \"str\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"category_id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"price_cents\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"stock_qty\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"Product\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"MissingRequiredFieldError\",\n            \"InvalidSkuError\",\n            \"InvalidPriceError\",\n            \"InvalidStockQtyError\",\n            \"CategoryNotFoundError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"read_one_product\",\n          \"description\": \"Reads a single product by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"return_type\": \"Optional[Product]\",\n          \"raises\": [\n            \"InvalidIdError\",\n            \"ProductNotFoundError\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"read_all_products\",\n          \"description\": \"Reads all products from the database.\",\n          \"params\": [],\n          \"return_type\": \"List[Product]\",\n          \"raises\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"update_product\",\n          \"description\": \"Updates a product's fields by its ID.\",\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"id\",\n              \"type\": \"int\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"name\",\n              \"type\": \"Optional[str]\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"category_id\",\n              \"type\": \"Optional[int]\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"price_cents\",\n              \"type\": \"Optional[int]\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"stock_qty\",\n              \"type\": \"Op\n\n===== invariants.json =====\n{\n  \"invariants\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Category.id is an auto-incremented primary key\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Category.name must be unique\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Category.description is nullable\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Category.reorder_threshold must be a non-negative integer if provided\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.id is an auto-incremented primary key\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.sku must be unique\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.name is required\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.category_id must reference an existing Category\",\n      \"kind\": \"rule\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.price_cents must be a positive integer\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.stock_qty must be a non-negative integer\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product.low_active is nullable and defaults to False\",\n      \"kind\": \"schema\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"
