ad_method_contracts` returns `(records, dropped)`. For the review, stale records dropped; the review asks. The generator's `load_context` uses current requirements; if no requirements, current None -> keep all. The `load_context` calls `load_requirements` which returns text. Good.\n- `save_method_contracts`: write `{KEY: records}`; add newline.\n- `contract_for`: iterate; return first matching holder/method with decided_by user? If no. Use exact.\n- `contract_index`: dict.\n- `render_contract_lines` maybe in generator, not here.\n\nLet's write.",
          "state": {
